WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.390
Early morning.

2
00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:07.110
A small shelf holds a candle, fresh
flowers and a curl of incense smoke.

3
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:11.620
Someone bows 3 times, then
begins a steady chant in Pali,

4
00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.390
an ancient language.

5
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.260
Yet most Buddhists do not see
the Buddha as a creator God.

6
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:22.390
So why bow, chant and leave flowers
before someone who is not a god?

7
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:26.220
In this mission, you'll hear
the chants and mantras of puja,

8
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.680
from the Three Refuges
to Om mani padme hum.

9
00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.600
Then you'll compare
puja across traditions,

10
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.940
from Pali chanting to
Tibetan prayer wheels.

11
00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:39.130
Your mission: find out why Buddhists bow,

12
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.230
chant and leave flowers before
someone they do not call a god.
